# Fixes upload block ownership and batch budgeting before installing a pooled block.
# Pooled reservations count each aligned texture allocation; resident capacity reports materialized private blocks.
# Retains temporary blocks before switching; pool slots are returned only on GPU feedback.
# Diagnostics distinguish resident reuse, cold pool creation, exhaustion, useful bytes, and resident capacity.
